# Shell scripts MUST keep LF. core.autocrlf=true on this box would otherwise
# hand you CRLF copies on the next checkout, and stream/pi/setup-pi.sh is meant
# to be copied straight onto a Raspberry Pi — where CRLF fails with a cryptic
# "\r: command not found".
*.sh text eol=lf

# Keep the rest sane and stop binaries being diffed/converted.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
